1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:04,143
(Sheldon:)Only a suggestion. A catch in your throat
would work just as well.

2
00:00:05,104 --> 00:00:06,354
[GROANS]

3
00:00:06,522 --> 00:00:10,862
[VOICE CRACKING] "But it is a fact
that it's a privilege to know you.

4
00:00:11,694 --> 00:00:13,694
Totally."

5
00:00:16,532 --> 00:00:19,122
(Sheldon:)Maybe you should put on
your Juicy pants again.

6
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:23,284
(Judge:)Pay the cashier.

7
00:00:24,832 --> 00:00:26,042
(Penny:)Sheldon Cooper.

8
00:00:28,878 --> 00:00:30,378
Good morning, Your Honor.

9
00:00:30,546 --> 00:00:35,886
(Sheldon:)Dr. Sheldon Cooper appearing in pro se.
That is to say, representing himself.

10
00:00:36,052 --> 00:00:38,682
(Judge:)I know what it means.
I went to law school.

11
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:42,347
(Sheldon:)And yet you wound up in traffic court.

12
00:00:43,643 --> 00:00:47,143
(Sheldon:)If it would please the court,
I'd like to begin with an opening statement.

13
00:00:47,313 --> 00:00:49,313
(Judge:)The court would advise you
to make it quick.

14
00:00:49,482 --> 00:00:53,982
(Judge:)The court had a dicey-looking
breakfast burrito and just took an Imodium.

15
00:00:55,237 --> 00:00:58,697
(Sheldon:)Very well. A quick opening statement.

16
00:00:58,866 --> 00:01:03,036
(Sheldon:)Like a milking stool,
my case rests on three legs.

